From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:01:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] hub claim screen: name deferred cards in tick
 diagnostics; re-read each card's row at its turn

Follow-ups from review t_01a1d2b04a906447 of #1811:
- DispatchResult.admission_deferred carries the ids the claim screen left
  unclaimed (unjudged) this tick; kanban dispatch --json/text, the stuck
  warning's held-card list and the screen's log line now name them.
- screen() re-reads each card's row with its event head when its turn comes,
  so a write to a later card during an earlier judge call no longer defers it
  (and wastes its judge call); a card no longer screenable is skipped.
